- Brake discs/rotors, drums, calipers, pads, shoes, master cylinders (if treated as brake parts), boosters/servo units, brake hoses if treated as brake parts in your dataset.

Common confusion:
- Hydraulic parts (pumps/valves) that have their own headings -> may not be 870830.
Key test:
- Is it part of the braking system whose primary role is braking?



⚠️ CRITICAL INSTRUCTION PRIORITY:

If "SPECIFIC CLASSIFICATION EMPHASIS FOR THIS HEADING" appears above:
