Consider these official classification guidelines:

1. [025/94] 87.08 Bodies (including cabs) for trucks and/or pickup trucks
   Bodies for trucks or pickup trucks are the coachwork of those vehicles. Therefore, the classification of said bodies is under subheading 87.07.9090. Parts of such bodies are classified under subheading 87.08.2000, subject to the classification rules in the tariff. File 87.08 025/94
