   Below is the decision made by the Supreme Classification Committee held on 7.11.17: The electric ATV shown in the picture, weighing approximately 65 kg, with a motor power of 1000 watts, a maximum (limited) speed of 8 km/h, a battery voltage of 48 volts, a seat height of approximately 65 cm, and a wheel diameter of 16 inches, shall be classified under subheading 87.03.8090, which refers to other motor vehicles principally designed for the transport of persons, powered by an electric motor. The classification shall not be determined under customs heading 95.03, which refers to wheeled toys, due to the lack of safety in use, lack of parental supervision, and the suitability of the ATV for an adult. Effective from 7.11.2017 014/18.

