     → CONDITIONAL: Monitors come in many sizes

KEY TEST FOR WEIGHT/SIZE:
Ask: "Does EVERY instance of this object type fall within this range/threshold?"
- If YES (typical range for this category) → DEFINITIVE expansion allowed
- If NO (varies significantly between instances) → CONDITIONAL, must be explicit

RULES:
- For DEFINITIVE information: You MAY expand from the item description
  Example: "salmon" + requirement "must be fish" → YES (inherent definition)

- For CONDITIONAL information: You MUST see it EXPLICITLY in the description
  Example: "salmon" + requirement "must be frozen" → INSUFFICIENT_INFORMATION
