Title (English):  Other with level of air pollution of 1 or 2 witch :cylinder capacity doesn't exceed 3,000 cc
Description: Other vehicles with air pollution level 1-2, cylinder capacity ≤3,000cc, not taxis/cluster/cadaver/ambulances/unlicensed
Hierarchy Path: Section XVII: VEHICLES, AIRCRAFT, VESSELS AND ASSOCIATED TRANSPORT EQUIPMENT || Vehicles other than railway or tramway rollingstock, and parts and accessories thereof || Motor cars and other motor vehicles principally designed for the transport of persons (other than those of heading 87.02), including station wagons and racing cars. || Other vehicles, with both sparkignition internal combustion piston engine and electric motor as motors for propulsion, capable of being charged by plugging to external source of electric power || Other with level of air pollution of 1 or 2 witch :cylinder capacity doesn't exceed 3,000 cc

REQUIREMENTS (from this item + inherited from ancestors):
1. Must be motor cars or other motor vehicles principally designed for the transport of persons
2. Must have both spark-ignition internal combustion piston engine and electric motor as motors for propulsion
3. Must be capable of being charged by plugging to external source of electric power
4. Must have level of air pollution of 1 or 2
5. Must have cylinder capacity not exceeding 3,000 cc

EXCLUSIONS:
1. Excludes taxicabs (8703601000)
2. Excludes cluster vehicles (8703602000)
3. Excludes vehicles which are outfitted or will be outfitted specially for transporting cadavers for burial and are used as stated, provided their importation was approved by the Director prior to importation (8703603000)
4. Excludes ambulances and chassis on which driver's cabs are mounted, used for assembling ambulances (8703604000)
5. Excludes motor vehicles for which a vehicle license or permit to move on roads has not been issued by the Licensing Authority, and as long as they do not move on roads, provided that conditions stated in rule 7 of Additional (Israeli) rules of Chapter 87 are met (8703605000)
6. Excludes small tractors and field vehicles (8703606000)
7. Excludes vehicles of a permissible gross vehicle weight exceeding 4500 kg (8703608000)

