  2. Must be switches
  3. Must be rotary wafer switches
Then cited_requirements MUST have 3 entries - one for EACH requirement above!

CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:
1. The array MUST contain EXACTLY 9 entries
2. Each entry MUST have: candidate_id, category_fit_analysis, category_match, result, reasoning, cited_requirements
3. candidate_id MUST match the ID shown in each candidate section above
