Hierarchy Path: ,Section XVIII: OPTICAL, PHOTOGRAPHIC, CINEMATOGRAPHIC MEASURING, CHECKING, PRECISION, MEDICAL OR SURGICAL INSTRUMENTS AND APPARATUS; CLOCKS AND WATCHES; MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS; PARTS AND ACCESSORIES THEREOF || Optical, photographic, cinematographic, measuring, checking, precision, medical or surgical instruments and apparatus; parts and accessories thereof || Apparatus and equipment for photographic (including cinematographic) laboratories, not specified or included elsewhere in this Chapter; negatoscopes; projection screens.

REQUIREMENTS (from this item + inherited from ancestors):
1. Must be apparatus and equipment for photographic (including cinematographic) laboratories OR negatoscopes OR projection screens
2. Must not be specified or included elsewhere in Chapter 90

EXCLUSIONS:
1. Excludes frames and mountings for spectacles, goggles or the like, and parts thereof (9003000000)
2. Excludes cinematographic cameras and projectors, whether or not incorporating sound recording or reproducing apparatus (9007000000)
3. Excludes compound optical microscopes, including those for photomicrography, cinephotomicrography or microprojection (9011000000)
4. Excludes surveying (including photogrammetrical surveying), hydrographic, oceanographic, hydrological, meteorological or geophysical instruments and appliances, excluding compasses; rangefinders (9015000000)
5. Excludes balances of a sensitivity of 5 cg or better, with or without weights (9016000000)
6. Excludes drawing, marking-out or mathematical calculating instruments and instruments for measuring length, for use in the hand (9017000000)
7. Excludes hydrometers and similar floating instruments, thermometers, pyrometers, barometers, hygrometers and psychrometers, recording or not, and any combination of these instruments (9025000000)
8. Excludes instruments and apparatus for physical or chemical analysis and instruments and apparatus for measuring or checking viscosity, porosity (9027000000)
9. Excludes gas, liquid or electricity supply or production meters, including calibrating meters therefor (9028000000)
10. Excludes automatic regulating or controlling instruments and apparatus (9032000000)

