1. [010/89] 69.10 Toilets and flushing cisterns adapted for installation as a single unit.
   Such goods consist of toilets upon which a flushing cistern is installed, matched in dimensions, connections, and additional specifications (such as color). These goods constitute a single unit within the meaning of General Interpretative Rule 3(b) of the classification rules, and therefore their classification is as toilets under subheadings 69.10.1020 and 69.10.9020. The goods are generally imported packed separately on pallets for transport convenience. Attention should be paid to the separate import of toilets and flushing cisterns if these are split shipments, in which case Section 136 of the Customs Ordinance and/or Section 14 of the Purchase Tax Law apply. Customs File: 69.10 010/89

